1
00:00:05,851 --> 00:00:09,181
Every time we eat here, your mom refuses
to let me help with the dishes.

2
00:00:09,354 --> 00:00:10,584
(Howard:)Don't take it personally.

3
00:00:10,756 --> 00:00:14,746
(Howard:)She likes doing them by herself so she can
lick the plates with no one looking.

4
00:00:15,494 --> 00:00:16,654
(Bernadette:)You ready to go?

5
00:00:16,828 --> 00:00:21,098
(Howard:)Yeah, let me just grab a couple
of fresh turtlenecks.

6
00:00:21,266 --> 00:00:24,826
(Bernadette:)I don't understand why you keep your stuff
here when there's room at home.

7
00:00:25,003 --> 00:00:26,263
(Howard:)What are you talking about?

8
00:00:26,438 --> 00:00:30,638
(Howard:)All I have here is a few sweaters,
books, bank stuff...

9
00:00:30,809 --> 00:00:34,179
(Howard:)...computers, mail, collectibles, medicine
and my electric body groomer.

10
00:00:35,981 --> 00:00:38,741
Ooh! There's my plaid dickey.

11
00:00:38,917 --> 00:00:43,717
(Howard:)Oh. Got this at the Goodwill store for 50 cents.
Can you believe it? Heh.

12
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,790
Fifty cents sounds right.

13
00:00:49,628 --> 00:00:51,858
(Bernadette:)- Let's go.
- You know, it's kind of late.

14
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:55,020
- Why don't we spend the night here?
- Because we don't live here.

15
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,760
(Sheldon:)- I know.
- Do you?

16
00:00:56,935 --> 00:00:58,805
(Bernadette:)You said when you got back from space...

17
00:00:58,970 --> 00:01:02,340
(Bernadette:)...you were gonna move into my apartment,
but half the time we stay here.

